{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15735","headline":"过终南柳处士 · 司空曙","name":"过终南柳处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云起山苍苍，林居萝薜荒。\n幽人老深境，素发与青裳。\n雨涤莓苔绿，风摇松桂香。\n洞泉分溜浅，岩笋出藂长。\n败屦安松砌，余棊在石牀。\n书名一爲别，还路已堪伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}